==Battleground==
*1 [[Snache]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*1 [[Snache]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*2 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Metal Snache]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Doge]] spawns.
**3 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 28.67 seconds<sup>860f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**5 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2.67 seconds<sup>80f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

